hat.com/images/ppt-off.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"ppt\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"oddbox\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>LDAP Injection &amp; Blind LDAP Injection</h2>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a name=\"Alonso\"></a><strong>Chema Alonso, </strong> Microsoft</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a name=\"Gimeno\"></a><strong>Jose Parada Gimeno, </strong>Microsoft</h3><br>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/video-off.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"video\"></a>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/audio-off.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"audio\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://blackhat.com/presentations/bh-europe-08/Alonso-Parada/Whitepaper/bh-eu-08-alonso-parada-WP.pdf\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/presentation.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"presentation\"></a>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://blackhat.com/presentations/bh-europe-08/Alonso-Parada/Presentation/bh-eu-08-alonso-parada.pdf\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/ppt.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"ppt\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://blackhat.com/presentations/bh-europe-08/Alonso-Parada/Extras/LdapInjector_final.zip\"><img src=\"https://blackhat.com/images/tools.gif\" height=\"30\" class=\"k\" alt=\"Extras/Tools\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"evenbox\">\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Malware on the Net - Behind the Scenes</h2>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a name=\"Amit\"></a><strong>Iftach Ian Amit,</strong> Director of Security Research, Finjan</h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t